WEBVTT

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:02.930
Achoo!

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:06.730
Cold... I'm so cold...

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.760
Warm me up... Somebody warm me up...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.070
What's wrong with you?!

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.900
Don't you get it?!

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.940
Darkness went to deal with that lord 
last night and never came back!

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.040
She's probably...

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:28.420
Megumin?

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.860
What's with the cat?

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:32.920
I doubt she'll cause much trouble, so...

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.940
You want to keep her?

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.150
Is that all right?

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.980
Ow!

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.680
Hey, why'd she only scratch me?!

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:42.950
Unbelievable!

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.980
Between the jet black fur 
and the imperious attitude,

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.410
I can sense some sort of malevolent aura!

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:51.070
So, what do you call this demonic beast?

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:52.640
Chomusuke.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:54.930
What'd you—

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:55.820
She's Chomusuke.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:01.040
Anyway, what were the two 
of you making a fuss about?

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.510
How can you be so calm?

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:04.750
As we speak, Darkness might be...

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.530
There may be unsavory rumors about that lord,

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.030
but I doubt Darkness could easily be—

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:10.590
That's the problem with children!

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.590
You still don't understand 
that deviant at all!

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:18.180
You can do what you want with my body...

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:21.140
"But don't think you'll have 
your way with my heart!"

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:23.520
She's sure to say something like that.

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:26.230
Wh-Wh-What should we do?!

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:27.660
Darkness is in grave danger!

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:29.340
What should we do, Kazuma?!

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:30.780
It's too late.

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:32.770
Listen up. When she gets back,

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:35.070
just be as nice to her as you normally would.

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:36.570
I-I get it!

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:40.850
So we can't ask Darkness what it was 
like to climb the stairs to adulthood!

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:44.180
Darkness... Darkness, she's...

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:43.450
Satou Kazuma!

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.250
Is Satou Kazuma here?!

00:01:54.380 --> 00:02:01.640
<b>KONOSUBA!
God's Blessing on this Wonderful World! 2</b>

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:23.720
<b>Kill Quest</b>

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:23.590
<b>Defeat the monsters in the vicinity of Axel</b>

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:27.440
No!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.420
<i>While they were trying to spring me,</i>

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:34.310
<b>Episode 2   A Friend for This Crimson Demon Girl!</b>

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.810
<i>Megumin had cast her explosion 
magic all over the place.</i>

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:39.570
<i>Thanks to that, the Giant Toads that 
had been hibernating woke up early.</i>

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:38.320
Help!

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:43.320
<i>So, we're here to clean up her mess, but...</i>

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:43.440
No!

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:46.280
I don't wanna be toad food again!

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:50.080
The toads haven't slowed 
down, despite the cold...

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.860
Aren't they a little too hardy?

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.150
We will not be outdone!

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:58.380
We must get much, much 
stronger in order to survive

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:00.380
in this cruel world.

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:01.880
I'll get you out—

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.220
No, please, help Aqua first.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.880
It's cold outside, but it's quite 
warm inside this toad.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:11.240
Having already cast my explosion magic,

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:13.140
all I can do is slow this one down.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.630
O-Okay, I'll leave you to it.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.090
Is that a good idea?!

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.740
Kazuma-san!

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:20.620
I can't! I just can't!

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:22.940
Hurry and do something!

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:28.030
<i>Even with Darkness to act as 
a sturdy wall for our party,</i>

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:30.900
<i>none of us had an effective ranged attack.</i>

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.220
<i>In light of that, I decided 
to learn a new skill.</i>

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:35.720
<i>And it's called...</i>

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:36.790
<i>Snipe!</i>

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:42.700
<i>The Snipe skill has higher accuracy 
the higher your luck stat is.</i>

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.390
<i>It's a perfect fit for me!</i>

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.050
Kazuma-san...

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:58.290
Hey! That arrow almost messed 
up the best part of my hair—

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.030
Aqua!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:04.950
KONOSUBA!

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:12.540
My skill... My skill...

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.980
A-Are you people always like this?

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:17.290
W-Wait a moment!

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:18.880
The toads!

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:22.250
This is bad! Now there's not enough bai—

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.840
I mean, enough decoys to keep them occupied!

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.920
Aqua, you should still be 
keeping them occupied!

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:30.970
No way! You be the decoy this time!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.100
Stupid! You don't have enough 
attack power to beat these toads!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.310
If we can beat even one of them, 
that'd leave just two!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.770
Then you and Sena-san can 
keep them busy together!

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:42.520
I'm just here to supervise you all, 
not to get dragged into—

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:49.210
Kazuma, there's your chance!

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:50.870
Hurry and get the toa—

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.570
No!

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:56.540
You guys!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.970
Excuse me, but I think I'm 
slowly being swallowed.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.250
Could you rescue me now, please?

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:04.540
Aw, damn it!

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:06.470
If only Darkness were here!

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:23.650
We're doomed!

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.440
Light of Saber!

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:44.000
KONOSUBA!

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:47.770
<i>I honestly don't want to touch them...</i>

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.910
You should be able to walk now.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.960
I don't know who you are, but thanks.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.820
I-I wasn't trying to save you.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:03.290
If my rival had been eaten by 
a toad, I'd look ridiculous...

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:05.600
Rival?

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:10.750
I-It's been a long time, Megumin!

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:13.940
Today is the day we finally 
settle our long-standing score!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.720
Who might you be, exactly?

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.650
I mean, it's strange that 
you never gave your name.

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:25.470
This must be one of those "Hey, it's me!" 
scams that Kazuma described before.

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:27.340
F-Fine, then!

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.480
It's embarrassing to do this 
in front of strangers, but...

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.840
My name is Yunyun!

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:37.370
An arch wizard and master 
of advanced magic!

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:39.890
She who will one day lead the Crimson Demons!

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.230
Anyway, this is Yunyun.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:46.070
Daughter of the Crimson Demons' leader, 
and my self-proclaimed rival.

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:47.650
So you <i>did</i> remember!

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:51.530
I see. Well, I'm one of her 
adventuring friends, Kazuma.

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.280
Nice to meet you, Yunyun.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:54.840
H-Huh?

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:57.700
You're not laughing at my name?

00:07:58.030 --> 00:07:59.680
Well, y'know, in this world of ours,

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:02.150
there are some who have weird 
names in the first place,

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:06.900
but still end up with disgraceful 
nicknames like "Crazy Exploding Girl."

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.930
You mean me? You're talking 
about me, aren't you?!

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:13.630
How did that name attach itself to me 
and I'm only now hearing about it?!

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:17.220
I-Impressive, Megumin. 
You've found good allies!

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.220
Cut it out! Don't touch me!

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:19.520
As befits my rival!

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:23.350
I'll defeat you and become 
first among the Crimson Demons!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:26.730
Now, Megumin, I challenge you to a duel!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.900
I'd rather not. It's too cold.

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:30.570
Why?!

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:33.380
Please, fight me!

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:34.810
No, thank you.

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:35.580
Please!

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.300
One fight! Just once!

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:38.840
You somehow managed today,

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:38.040
No.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:41.160
Then when can we have a duel?!

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:43.130
but I'm not fully convinced this 
wasn't just an act to deceive me.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:41.960
How should I know?

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:44.710
But why?! Megumin!

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:43.740
Excuse me.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:49.590
Well, I'll make arrangements for the 
guild to haul the toad meat in.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:45.550
I said no.

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:48.540
Come on, Megumin! Just one little duel!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.260
Not happening.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:53.120
<i>I don't really appreciate being left 
on my own with these two...</i>

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:53.340
Aw, come on, Megumin!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:56.930
Very well, then.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:00.670
I can no longer use my magic today,

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:04.230
so let's make it a contest in the martial arts 
that you're supposed to be skilled at.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.630
Really?

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:09.980
I mean, you barely attended 
martial arts class at the academy...

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:13.690
<i>Stare.</i>

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:14.000
And every lunch period, 
you'd show up like clockwork,

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:16.410
<i>Stare...</i>

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:17.300
challenge me to a duel, 
and then steal my lunch...

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.870
<i>Stare...</i>

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:20.500
Girl...

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.840
It was a matter of life and death for me.

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:26.080
Due to personal circumstances, her lunches 
were the only thing keeping me alive.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:29.230
All right, then that will be how we fight!

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:30.460
Seriously?

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.210
Very well.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.110
Now then, come at me as you will!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:43.350
<i>Judging from their builds, it looks 
like Yunyun's gonna win this.</i>

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:47.190
<i>I can't even begin to imagine Megumin 
being any good at unarmed combat.</i>

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.610
M-Megumin...

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:58.320
Um, your body's still kind of shiny...

00:09:58.560 --> 00:09:59.930
That's right.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:04.290
What you see clinging to every inch of me 
are the fluids from inside a toad's stomach.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:07.020
Come! The moment you get close to me,

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.850
I'll grab you with both arms

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:11.380
and put you in a submission hold!

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.590
N-No way!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:17.380
You're trying to make me lose my will 
to fight so I'll give up, aren't you?

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:18.540
Right?

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.660
We're friends, aren't we?

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:27.480
And I believe friendship means 
sharing in each other's suffering.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.260
No!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:31.190
C'mon. C'mon. C'mon.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:34.640
C'mon! C'mon! C'mon!

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.860
I give up! I'll give up!

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.680
Stay away from me!

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:35.650
C'mon!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:41.250
I give up! I already gave up!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.510
I win again!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.870
S-Stop it!

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:48.870
Damn you!

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:50.790
K-Kill—

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:54.320
She actually ran off crying.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:55.380
Kazuma.

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:56.960
The spoils of war.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.630
Sell it to start making your payments.

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:00.150
Are you sure?

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.110
It is of no use to a grand sorceress 
such as myself, who operates beyond

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:05.470
the bounds of society.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.690
Do you ever think about learning 
skills other than explosion ma—

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:10.230
Never.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:11.830
Yeah, I figured.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:15.440
What is it?

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:19.110
I was just thinking that you're 
prettier than that other girl.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.740
Wait!

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:24.640
Well, thank you very much!

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:26.820
As thanks, let me give you a big hug!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.000
S-Stay away from me!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.330
You should be happier.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:35.380
Some people would pay money to 
have a slimy girl all over them.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.130
You reek of toads!

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:42.850
I never thought an embrace 
could be so unpleasant...

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:45.240
Chomusuke!

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:46.810
Were you a good—

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.770
Well, I'm off to the bath.

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:54.700
What is it?

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:57.520
Surely you've heard of "ladies first"?

00:11:57.740 --> 00:12:00.540
I yearn for true gender equality.

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:03.240
I have no patience for one who talks about 
female privilege when it suits them,

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:07.280
and then complains about someone 
"not being a man" when it's convenient!

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:18.060
Besides, if you want to be treated like 
a lady, you should grow into one first!

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:20.500
You're treating me like a 
child again, aren't you?!

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:23.020
For the record, I'm only 
three years younger than you!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:27.220
Yet you seem like just a kid to me, 
so you're wasting your time!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.460
This guy's actually taking his clothes off!

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:30.850
I'm not backing down on this one!

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:32.430
No matter what! Get it?!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.400
If you do, then get out of here already!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:39.940
I see. So you don't really 
see me as a woman, then.

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.530
In that case, I may as well join you.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:45.090
True. Getting in together 
will solve both our problems.

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:46.000
Wha?!

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.770
E-Excuse me, doesn't this usually 
call for a response like,

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:50.880
"D-Dummy! I could never do that!"

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:53.310
And then bashfully allowing 
me to use the bath first?

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:57.640
Just so you know, I'm not 
the type to go for clichés.

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:59.900
Say, for instance, you were in love with me,

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:02.340
and some other girl was making moves on me.

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:05.760
If you were to, out of jealousy, 
inflict some unjust violence on me,

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.690
I would fight back with no hesitation.

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:09.600
I'm a guy who does what he has to do!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.600
You'd do well to remember that!

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:17.560
I get the feeling your application of that 
saying leaves something to be desired,

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.090
but all right, fine.

00:13:19.090 --> 00:13:21.570
So after provoking me like that,
you're not gonna join me?

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:23.310
I'm surprised at your lack of resolve.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.530
How dare you?!

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.590
You think I lack resolve?!

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:27.370
Yep.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:28.900
Them's fighting words! Fine, I'll get in!

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:30.490
It's just a bath! I can do that!

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:30.490
Ouch!

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:34.480
Now, stop skulking behind that towel, 
and and let's get in the bath!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.520
Whoa, whoa, whoa! What are you doing?!

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:35.020
Stop, you idiot!

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.330
Don't pull on it, you perv! Show a little shame!

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.580
Out with it!

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:44.880
Hey.

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:45.800
Yes?

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:49.030
I thought cats didn't like baths.

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.470
She likes to stay clean.

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:53.200
Hey...

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:54.180
Yes?

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:56.690
Is that other girl gonna be okay?

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.650
I'm sure I'll see her again.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.400
She chases after me, 
claiming to be my rival, after all.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:04.400
She's the same age as you, right?

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:08.320
Why don't you just come out and say what you 
were thinking when you looked at me just now?

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:12.090
I was thinking how everybody 
matures at their own pace—

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:15.080
Darkness blacker than black
and darker than dark...

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:13.290
Hey, cut that out!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.080
It's bad for my heart!

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.710
I'm sure that in another year or two,

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:20.520
I'll have a body that'll have 
Yunyun crying for forgiveness...

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:25.090
I would appreciate it if you'd 
stop staring so intently!

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:29.800
Why are we in the bath together?

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:31.680
Why bring that up now?

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.020
Why would you suddenly come to your senses?!

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:39.460
Well, I mean, anyone seeing 
this would probably react—

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:40.700
I'm back!

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:45.270
Hey, I got the cash for the toad meat!

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:46.210
Is it locked?!

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:48.000
Did you lock the door to the bath?!

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.940
I-I didn't!

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:51.700
Wh-Wh-What do we do?!

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.060
Kazuma? Megumin? I'm back!

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.370
It'd be nice if someone would say something!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.050
Huh? The bath?

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:02.910
Freeze!

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:09.650
Either I'm doomed, or my magic holds out!

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:07.100
Hey!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.010
Anyone there?

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:11.970
Hold out, magic power of mine!

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:15.170
If Aqua sees us, it'll mean getting 
called "Pedo-NEET" and "Lolimaniac"

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:18.270
and other disgraceful nicknames!

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:23.770
<i>I don't even have the strength to stand.</i>

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:29.110
Megumin, when you get out of 
the bath, let's have lunch.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.740
Actually, get out of there already.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:33.660
I'm all slimy myself, y'know!

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:40.750
That was a close one. If things 
had gone on much longer...

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:44.080
I almost got branded a lolicon.

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:45.870
Hey, Megumin.

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:48.510
Sorry to ask, but I can't move, 
so could you dry me off?

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:49.740
Hey.

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:57.020
Why don't you explain exactly why getting 
into the bath with me makes you a lolicon?

00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:58.150
Hey, wait, stop it!

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.640
What are you trying to do?! 
You'll be branded a female pervert!

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:01.990
Hey, A-Aqua!

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:05.150
Aqua! The little girl is bullying me!

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:10.640
Pedo-NEET.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.280
<b>12 Giant Toads Killed</b>

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:14.280
<b>Today's Results</b>

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:20.850
<i>The day after receiving 
my disgraceful title,</i>

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:25.470
<i>we dropped by Wiz's shop to figure 
out what to do about my debt.</i>

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:26.460
Hey!

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:28.460
I'm looking to sell this.

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:30.920
She's here to—

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.220
M-My name is Yunyun!

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:35.050
What a coincidence!

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.910
What a quirk of fate!

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.930
To think that we would 
have an encounter here!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.930
You truly are my lifelong rival!

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:44.180
She heard that you all 
visit my store regularly

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:45.730
and has been waiting all morning.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.020
Wh-What are you saying, shopkeep?!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.780
I just came by to buy some magic items...

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.700
U-Um, I'd like this!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:53.950
KONOSUBA!

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:56.320
I see.

00:16:56.680 --> 00:17:00.160
You could've just come by the 
mansion instead of doing all this.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.410
But I can't just visit someone's 
home unannounced...

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.610
It's always half-measures with you.

00:17:05.610 --> 00:17:06.990
That's why you can't make friends.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:07.670
Is that true?

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.630
Yunyun is the rare Crimson Demon 
who's embarrassed by her name.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.630
She would usually eat lunch 
alone at the academy.

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:14.990
Now, now.

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:17.860
And whenever I would cross her line of sight,

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.760
she'd gleefully challenge me over and over.

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:22.750
I-It wasn't that bad!

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.140
I did have some friends.

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:26.690
I can hardly believe what I'm hearing.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.110
You had friends, Yunyun?

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:31.100
Of course! Even I had friends!

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:33.320
There was Funifura-san and Dodonko-san,

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:37.240
who would always say, "We're friends, right?" 
and I would treat them to lunch...

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.390
Hey, stop!

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.290
I don't want to hear any more!

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:43.590
Well, since I can only use explosion magic,

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:46.050
I would rather avoid magic duels.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:48.680
Would you learn some other magic already?

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:50.880
You're bound to have unused 
skill points, right?

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.340
Yes, I do.

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:56.230
And I intend to put them all into 
"Explosion Magic Power Boost"

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:58.180
and "High-Speed Casting."

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:01.640
Stupid! Why are you so obsessed 
with explosion magic?!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.430
That's right, you tell her!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:06.150
You've always been this way, Megumin!

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:07.690
All this talk of duels... 
For classmates, you guys sure are vicious.

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:09.920
Your lack of appreciation for explosion 
magic makes you the crazy one.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:09.830
Hey, hey.

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:12.210
Maybe this would be good?

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:13.840
"The friendship crystal."

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:19.190
Oh, only a seasoned magic user 
can use that effectively.

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:22.330
If you can use it well, can you make friends?

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.020
Well, yes.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:25.950
I know! Why not try it?

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.530
I hardly see the need to make friends...

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:31.520
Have you lost your nerve, Megumin?

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:33.340
In other words,

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.970
being able to use this more effectively 
is proof of greater spell casting skill!

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:38.970
I challenge you, Megumin!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.970
If you insist, then I will demonstrate for you

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:44.970
the power of a true magic user!

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:47.430
Today is the day we settle this score!

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:54.320
Just what I'd expect from Crimson Demons.

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:57.570
Now, crystal, demonstrate your power!

00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:59.820
The crystal's power is activating!

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:10.610
It's never projected this much before!

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:12.000
They both have incredible magic!

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.620
What... is this?!

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.390
Is she gathering bread crusts?

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:26.820
Wait a minute...

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:32.440
Happy birthday!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.530
Is she... by herself?

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:37.990
Dang it!

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.910
Onee-chan, you're amazing!

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:49.500
Not bad! But how about this?!

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.920
You're so great!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:06.930
Onee-chan, this is great!

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:10.430
I wouldn't even mind a devil 
for a friend at this point...

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:14.730
She's working odd jobs to take 
her "friends" out to eat?!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.660
Wait, why is she...

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:18.190
eating a bug?

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:21.140
What is this?!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:23.740
Shopkeep, you said this crystal 
would create friendship, right?!

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:30.090
This is a valued item that deepens 
feelings of friendship and love

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:34.180
by exposing past embarrassment... actually...

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:36.610
Megumin! Hey, Megumin!

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.840
Is this going to make us friends?!

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:46.510
KONOSUBA!

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:49.770
I'll just put that on your tab, Kazuma-san.

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:52.730
Hang on. Megumin was the one who broke it.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:55.150
Yunyun was the one who wanted to use it.

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:56.700
She'll pay.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:59.070
My duel... I finally got her to duel, and...

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.780
How long are you going to mope?

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:03.980
But how do we know who won?

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:06.000
Can we call it a draw?

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:07.530
I don't mind.

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:11.540
I'm not childish enough to be 
competitive over games anymore.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:16.380
Come to think of it, didn't we used to 
compete to see who would grow faster?

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:19.880
If you think you're not childish anymore, 
do you want to do that again?

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:24.630
That's not what I mean when 
I talk about being childish.

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:27.140
After all, I'm...

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:34.440
in the kind of relationship with Kazuma 
here where we bathe together.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:35.130
Hey!

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:36.100
Oh, my!

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.130
Don't joke about that!

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:41.840
Is this the mouth?!

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:44.120
Is this the mouth trying to make 
my reputation even worse?!

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:45.780
I-I'll...

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:49.910
I'll admit that I lost today!

00:21:51.750 --> 00:21:53.020
Come again!

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:54.600
She's a lively girl.

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:55.620
You are, too.

00:21:58.430 --> 00:21:59.680
I win again!

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:40.180
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:40.180
<b>Peace for the Master of This Labyrinth!</b>

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:40.290
<b>Here is the progress report I said I would send. Mr. Kazuma seemed
like a problem at first, but he's become a seasoned and formidable adventurer.
Absolutely not the kind of person to sexually harass anyone or get into debt.
My assessment of his character proves to be on point. Yes, I am a really capable
goddess. I've even gained the respect of the construction bosses, so my daily wages
have gone up. I think I can keep working it and my side jobs with the fake flowers
and the milk cartons, at this rate. ...No, I don't just work part-time jobs!</b>

00:23:31.270 --> 00:23:33.560
Here is the progress report I said I would send.

00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:35.830
Mr. Kazuma seemed like a problem at first,

00:23:35.830 --> 00:23:38.680
but he's become a seasoned 
and formidable adventurer.

00:23:39.090 --> 00:23:40.680
Absolutely not the kind—
